<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final round scores in the</p>
<p>3.4 million rand (745,000 dollars) South African Open at par 72</p>
<p>Glendower golf course on Sunday (South African unless stated):</p>
<p>270 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 69 66 66 69</p>
<p>271 Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 72 66 65 68</p>
<p>275 Ernie Els 66 72 67 70, Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 69 69 68 69,</p>
<p>Fulton Allem 66 71 71 67</p>
<p>278 Retief Goosen 72 67 72 67 279 David Gilford (Britain) 69</p>
<p>66 74 70, Ian Woosnam (Britain) 66 75 69 69 280 Jean Van de</p>
<p>Velde</p>
<p>(France) 68 69 73 70, Sven Struver (Germany) 70 71 71 68,</p>
<p>Clinton Whitelaw 74 66 74 66</p>
<p>281 Eamonn Darcy (Ireland) 67 69 73 72, Andrew McLardy 72 71 69</p>
<p>69, Gary Evans (Britain) 68 72 72 69, Wayne Westner 69 70 73 69</p>
<p>282 Hennie Otto 74 68 68 72, Fran Quinn junior (U.S.) 69 72 72</p>
<p>69</p>
<p>284 Adam Hunter (Britain) 71 68 70 75, Thomas Bjorn (Denmark)</p>
<p>66 69 75 74, Trevor Dodds (Namibia) 72 70 71 71</p>
<p>285 Wayne Bradley 65 70 75 75, Ignacio Garrido (Spain) 70 73 71</p>
<p>71</p>
